      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Cloud Providers**\n\nI've decided to use a different cloud provider for the other files to showcase diversity. Initially, I used AWS Rekognition with `boto3` in `detect_image_labels.py`. Now, I'm going with Google Cloud services for the remaining files, which should offer a good comparison and highlight different services within Google's ecosystem.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI'm structuring the `vision_models.py` file. I'm focusing on defining data structures for requests and responses, so I'll be using `base64` for encoding image bytes, which will come in handy. It is great, it shows the data requirements for the project.\n\n\n",
